{"about_the_game":"Succubus Contract is dating-sim puzzle game with many beautiful women!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArriving in a new city you wanted to start a new life. This is a good city and there are a lot of beautiful girls!<br />\r\nUnfortunately, for some reason you didn't get along with the girls.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne evening you found a strange application in your phone. After trying to start the application, nothing seemed to happen ...<br />\r\nBut suddenly you realized that something incredible had actually happened! A succubus appeared in your room and offered to make a contract with her. <br />\r\nLooks like fun adventures waiting!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuring a meeting with girls you can talk to them or give a gift and receive special energy.<br />\r\nThis energy can be spent on improving your passive and active abilities, which will help you on dates.<br />\r\nDuring dates, you'll receive money, which you can buy gifts, food and drinks.<br />\r\nPerforming tasks for each girl, you will improve your relationship and fill their hearts with your love!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"aed0ced897859d2c673ad54c03f55cf1840aaec7.jpg","localized_name":"First steps!","name":"First steps!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1062220/aed0ced897859d2c673ad54c03f55cf1840aaec7.jpg"},{"icon":"ee2da1445e8e40e1dab08e2ac1a11aac21d08970.jpg","localized_name":"Izumi","name":"Izumi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1062220/ee2da1445e8e40e1dab08e2ac1a11aac21d08970.jpg"},{"icon":"cde06c4563c07c685c823a53867d132037482888.jpg","localized_name":"Kasumi","name":"Kasumi","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1062220/cde06c4563c07c685c823a53867d132037482888.jpg"},{"icon":"ecb0dda4206548235a1d212ebb8f1a0ea5908047.jpg","localized_name":"Reika","name":"Reika","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1062220/ecb0dda4206548235